63. Multiple changes + SAVEPOINT + undo later change + COMMIT

This combines everything.

START TRANSACTION;

UPDATE sales_orders
SET price = 1300
WHERE order_id = 2;

UPDATE sales_orders
SET price = 9000
WHERE order_id = 3;

SAVEPOINT correct_changes;

UPDATE sales_orders
SET price = -500
WHERE order_id = 4;

SELECT order_id, price
FROM sales_orders
WHERE order_id IN (2, 3, 4);

ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT correct_changes;

COMMIT;

