Order 3 → saved
Order 4 → incorrect update undone

This is basically the full TCL pattern:

START TRANSACTION
       ↓
  Correct changes
       ↓
   SAVEPOINT
       ↓
  Wrong change
       ↓
ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT
       ↓
    COMMIT

