63. BEFORE INSERT — negative discount becomes 0

The assignment asks for a trigger that changes a negative discount to 0.

DELIMITER //

CREATE TRIGGER before_order_insert_discount
BEFORE INSERT ON sales_orders
FOR EACH ROW
BEGIN
    IF NEW.discount < 0 THEN
        SET NEW.discount = 0;
    END IF;
END //

DELIMITER ;
Understand this

NEW.discount means:

The discount value that is about to be inserted.

So if:

discount = -5

the trigger changes it to:

discount = 0
